Package: com.iosvcam.opencam
Name: iOS-VCAM OpenCam
Version: 0.3.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Open-source, editable virtual camera + microphone tweak. Everything runs in mediaserverd so it covers every capture client (stock Camera, TikTok, all apps). Video: pulls an RTMP stream on-device, decodes H264 via VideoToolbox, overwrites the capture-graph pixel buffer in place; front camera auto-mirrors. Audio: global real-time-safe AudioUnitRender replacement fed by the PC audio bridge (127.10.10.10:1936), with a lock-free jitter buffer. Fail-open everywhere (any error falls back to the real camera/mic).
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.system-hook, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-probe, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.daemon, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
Replaces: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
